    "description": "All-road board only. Lightweight and high-performance, the Whitebird Mid Length is an ally for light wind, downwind, sup foil and sup foil downwind sessions. Its compact, accessible shape makes it an easy downwind freeride board with excellent stability. The width optimises ride-offset for good manoeuvrability and turning. Soft rails and a soft hull deliver tolerance on touchdowns with a gentle rebound. The hollow deck lowers the rider's centre of gravity for direct, precise foil feel; advanced foil-box positioning provides ultra-light-wind take-off capability with the inertia profile of a small board and the take-off behaviour of a long one.",
